OL,3,GNEWSAFamily given 'glimmer of hope' as
OL,4,Atoddler heads to US for cancer
OL,5,Atreatment
OL,6,
OL,7,FA mother whose three-year-old son must
OL,8,Ftravel to the US for a vaccine trial
OL,9,Fsaid it has given her family a "glimmer
OL,10,Fof hope" for his future.
OL,12,FAlmost a year ago, doctors warned Teddy
OL,13,FSloman's parents that he might not
OL,14,Fsurvive life-saving surgery after being
OL,15,Fdiagnosed with his high-risk
OL,16,Fneuroblastoma, a rare, aggressive
OL,17,Fchildhood cancer.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
