OL,3,GNEWSAFamily given 'glimmer of hope' as
OL,4,Atoddler heads to US for cancer
OL,5,Atreatment
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut recent scans showed no active
OL,8,Fdisease, and the family are preparing
OL,9,Fto fly to New York next month for what
OL,10,Fhis mum Sarah hopes will be "the final
OL,11,Fchapter" of his treatment and "the end
OL,12,Fof this ridiculous nightmare".
OL,14,F"We've now given him the absolute best
OL,15,Fchance that we could possibly have in
OL,16,Fthe world of medical science," she
OL,17,Fsaid.
